      "title": "Durable flushes and wait",
      "description": "The flush interval is a durability bound for acks=all, not a size target, so it cannot simply be raised. Durable wait is also a histogram: mean is _sum over _count, the tail comes from _bucket.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dg0i3veoyn5z4b"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dg0i3veoyn5z4b"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(kimistore_durable_flushes_total[5m]))",
